---
layout: null
permalink: /events.ics
sitemap: false
---
BEGIN:VCALENDAR
VERSION:2.0
PRODID:-//Humanities Innovation Lab//Events//EN
CALSCALE:GREGORIAN
METHOD:PUBLISH
X-WR-CALNAME:Humanities Innovation Lab events
X-WR-TIMEZONE:America/Edmonton
BEGIN:VTIMEZONE
TZID:America/Edmonton
X-LIC-LOCATION:America/Edmonton
BEGIN:DAYLIGHT
TZOFFSETFROM:-0700
TZOFFSETTO:-0600
TZNAME:MDT
DTSTART:19700308T020000
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY;BYMONTH=3;BYDAY=2SU
END:DAYLIGHT
BEGIN:STANDARD
TZOFFSETFROM:-0600
TZOFFSETTO:-0700
TZNAME:MST
DTSTART:19701101T020000
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY;BYMONTH=11;BYDAY=1SU
END:STANDARD
END:VTIMEZONE
{%- comment -%}
  Events carrying `start_time` and `end_time` (local 24-hour clock) become timed
  VEVENTs in America/Edmonton. The rest stay all-day: the times on the older Wix
  listings were free text, not structured data, so the original string is carried
  in the description instead of being parsed.

  For those, DTEND is exclusive, hence the +1 day — and the +1 goes via noon rather
  than midnight. `date: "%s"` reads a bare date as UTC midnight but renders the
  epoch back in the site timezone, so a midnight round trip lands on the previous
  evening and DTEND comes out equal to DTSTART.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- for e in site.data.events -%}
{%- assign start = e.date | date: "%Y%m%d" -%}
{%- assign noon = e.date | date: "%Y-%m-%dT12:00:00" -%}
{%- assign finish = noon | date: "%s" | plus: 86400 | date: "%Y%m%d" -%}
{%- capture desc -%}
{%- if e.when %}{{ e.when }}{% endif %}{% if e.description %} — {{ e.description }}{% endif %}{% if e.zoom %} Join on Zoom: {{ e.zoom }}{% endif %}{% if e.link %} {{ e.link }}{% endif %}
{%- endcapture %}
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:{{ e.title | slugify }}-{{ start }}@humanitiesinnovationlab.ca
DTSTAMP:{{ site.time | date: "%Y%m%dT%H%M%SZ" }}
{% if e.start_time and e.end_time %}DTSTART;TZID=America/Edmonton:{{ start }}T{{ e.start_time | remove: ":" }}00
DTEND;TZID=America/Edmonton:{{ start }}T{{ e.end_time | remove: ":" }}00
{% else %}DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:{{ start }}
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:{{ finish }}
{% endif %}SUMMARY:{{ e.title | replace: ";", "\;" | replace: ",", "\," | strip_newlines }}
{% if e.where %}LOCATION:{{ e.where | replace: ";", "\;" | replace: ",", "\," | strip_newlines }}
{% endif %}DESCRIPTION:{{ desc | strip | replace: ";", "\;" | replace: ",", "\," | strip_newlines }}
{% if e.zoom %}URL:{{ e.zoom }}
{% elsif e.link %}URL:{{ e.link | absolute_url }}
{% endif %}END:VEVENT
{%- endfor %}
END:VCALENDAR
